OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe morning will continue
OL,6,Fmostly dry with bright or sunny
OL,7,Fspells. Sunny spells will increase as
OL,8,Fthe afternoon continues dry. Cloud
OL,9,Fwill spread into the north from the
OL,10,Flate afternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FAfter a dry start with clear
OL,13,Fspells, cloud will spread south from
OL,14,Fthe evening. Scattered showers, wintry
OL,15,Fat height, will spread south from the
OL,16,Fevening. Becoming breezy.
OL,17,
OL,18,CThursday:FFurther blustery showers
OL,19,Fwill continue at times through the
OL,20,Fday, these wintry over high ground.
OL,21,FBreezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
